#. the quick action that puts a gap between the two screens, and its state
#. a row that opens the remote touch screen's page: the game's second screen in a phone's browser, and its code to scan
#: port/app/ingame.cpp:182 port/app/ingame.cpp:254 port/app/ingame.cpp:254 port/app/ingame3ds.cpp:476 port/app/ingame3ds.cpp:690 port/app/remote_menu.h:29 port/eden/ingame.cpp:562 port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:597 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:471 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1597 port/frontend/shell/switch_extras.cpp:54
#, menu
msgid "On"
msgstr "Be"

#. the quick action that puts a gap between the two screens, and its state
#. anti-aliasing in the Switch's in-game menu: none, or Eden's two methods (FXAA and SMAA, their own names)
#. Settings > Online: a row that opens the box art's settings (GameTDB on or off, downloading the covers again)
